  "caveats": [
    "Every baseline cell is n=1. The matched-knowledge control (dm4_plk1, 20.0) scores BELOW the no-knowledge prolong (dm4_pl, 40.0); with n=1 each this inversion is within plausible GUI-grind variance and should be read as such until more seeds land.",
    "Milestone scoring is a COUNT, not a sequence. Several world-model runs bank out of order (furnace before stone_pickaxe); that is within the rules but part of why the arm reaches the 60 band.",
    "On dragon the world-model margin over both baselines is exactly ONE milestone (furnace). PRO-LONG is also the fastest arm to 5/24 (step 3294, vs 3699-9035 for the world-model runs) \u2014 the advantage there comes from endgame banking, not front-chain speed.",
    "dm4_wmv (20.0, 2/10) is excluded from every aggregate: it ran a 1500-step budget, not 6000.",
    "The dragon prolong token figure is a lower bound only; do not quote it as a point estimate."
